Heath H8, Heath H89, Zenith Z89

This is a naked boot system image.
It starts with a configure tool, you can personalize it
before adding your files (or leave it alone).

   cpmtools\cpmcp -f h8d cpm14.h8d files\*.* 0:

----------------------------------------
CPMTOOLS diskdefs

# Heath Zenith H8 / H89
diskdef h8d
   seclen 256
   tracks 40
   sectrk 10
   blocksize 1024
   maxdir 32
   skew 4
   boottrk 3
   os 2.2
 end
----------------------------------------

